Models use synthetic core, regmap/work, firmware-property, resource,
ULPI and notifier services. They retain actual driver function bodies.
They do not test kernel ABI layout, concurrent execution, FF IOCTL core,
electrical PHY tuning, USB transfers/OTG, physical haptics or system PM.
